v1.7.0 (5/17/18)
    * Updated API for Summerset (100023)
    * Updated LAM to 2.0 r26
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.6.0 (2/6/18)
    * Updated API for Dragon Bones (100022)
    * Updated LAM to 2.0 r25
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.5.0 (6/10/17)
    * Updated API for Morrowind (100019)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.4.1 (2/5/17)
    * Fixed a small issue with other player names not showing when All setting
    turned on.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.4 (2/5/17)
    * Cleaned up some functions, have eliminated the use of the manual critter 
    list.
    * Fixed an issue where the reticle was not properly changing colors when name
    display options were turned off.
    * Updated options, now can also still show health values without name display. 
    The health text is not coloring as it should when name display is off, but reticle
    color is changing properly. Testing some further options refinement per user requests.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.3 (1/2/17)
    * Updated LibAddonMenu to 2.0 r23
    * Updated reticleover functions for human players (Thanks Baertram!)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
v1.2 (10/4/16)
	* - Updated LibAddonMenu to 2.0 r22
	* API updated, compatible with Shadows of The Hist (100016) and One 
    Tamriel (100017)

v1.1 (7/14/16)
	* - Updated LibAddonMenu to 2.0 r20
	* API updated, compatible with both Dark Brotherhood (100015) and Shadows 
	of The Hist (100016)
	* Removed Veteran Rank functions, replaced with Champion Rank equivalents
	* Partially updated the critter list - this is still a work in progress
	* Changed up the settings menu a bit - have some new functionality in mind
	for this for a future version as well.
	
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I'm including notes from the prior versions below.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.0.7 released 2015-06-27 (Monday 27 June 2015)
	- Update for Update 6 ("Tamerial Unlimited") and API version change.
	- Update LibAddonMenu to 2.0 r18 used for add-on settings menus
	- Code updates due to Reticle's StealthIcon changes

1.0.6 released 2014-11-03 (Monday 3 November 2014)
	- Update for Update 5 ("Veteran City of Ash") and API version change.
	- Update LibAddonMenu to 2.0 r16 used for add-on settings menus

1.0.5 released 2014-09-17 (Wednesday 17 September 2014)
	- Update for Update 4 ("Upper Craglorn") and API version change.
	- Improve the resetting of the Stealth "eye" reticle color being incorrectly 
	"stuck" at the previous non-default color (most commonly hostile or group) and 
	associated "stealth text" ("Hidden", "Detected").
	- There may be a small issue with the stealth text visibility, having to do with 
	how long it is visible for, but should be a minor annoyance with the text being 
	shown slightly too frequently or slightly too long.

1.0.4 released 2014-08-10 (Sunday 10 August 2014)
	- bug fix for error message when hiding (crouching).

1.0.3 released 2014-08-06 (Wednesday 6 August 2014)
	- bug fix release
	- only display guild, group, and friend coloring if enable
	- only display unit health / percent if a matching group is found (i.e. only with 
	name)
	- reset / hide unit health & percent text when no longer pointing at target
	- disable debugging by default, add menu option
	- does not work-around GetDisplayName() function working again
	(messes up saved settings for many add-ons), the benefit isn't worth the complexity
	/ risk or breaking something else (now or in the future)

1.0.2 - released 2014-08-04 (Monday 4 August 2014)
	- update for v1.3.3 (Armour Dyes) or API 100008

1.0.1 - beta of Rainbow Reticle (updated) by mctaylor (2014-08-03)
	- Beta which should work for upcoming v1.3.x, based on PTS v.1.3.x testing
	- Internal rewrite, hopefully more modular for new features
	- Updated LibStub 1.0 r2 (trivial) and LibAddonMenu to 2.0 r14 (major)
	- Now configuration options under Settings / Addon Settings
	- Add disclaimer to RainbowReticle.txt (add-on table of contents) and 00_README.rtf
	- Minor rewrite of About.rtf documentation, renamed to 00_README.rtf.
	- Much easier to implement a few requested features in the near future.

0.9b - release of Rainbow Reticle (updated) by Garkin (2014-07-21)
	- Updated for version v1.2.3 (Veteran Crypt of Hearts)
	- Changes to color functions

0.9a - first release of Rainbow Reticle (updated) by mctaylor (2014-06-13)
	- Updated for the v1.1 (Craglorn)
	- Correctly display Veteran Rank

0.9 - last version released by Mitazaki (2014-04-14)
	- Added Health numbers and health percentages to right of the reticle. This 
	can be enabled or disabled.
	- Added level indicator next to name. This also can be toggled on or off.
	- Tweaked the option menu.
	- You can now toggle on and off name plates for different types of targets.